•issue additional equity securities that would dilute our existing stockholders and impact our results of operations;

•use cash that we may need in the future to operate our business;

•incur large charges, expenses, or substantial liabilities;

•incur debt on terms unfavorable to us or that we are unable to repay; or

•become subject to adverse tax consequences, substantial depreciation, impairment, or deferred compensation charges.

